# REPLY | id | text. {name} is filled from the account name stored in the chat ledger.
REPLY | r_greet | Hi. I can chat with fixed replies for now. Type help.
REPLY | r_help | I know: hi, help, account, nav, bye. Numbers work too: 1 help, 2 quit.
REPLY | r_ask_name | What name should I use for you?
REPLY | r_named | Nice to meet you, {name}.
REPLY | r_nav | Navigation lives in the menu. Full nav comes with the window (M8).
REPLY | r_bye | bye
REPLY | r_fallback | I don't know that yet.
REPLY | r_done | The chat is closed. Start hai again to talk.
REPLY | r_ask_meaning | I do not know "{word}" yet. What does it mean to you? (type skip to pass)
REPLY | r_learned | Thank you. I will remember what you said about "{word}": {meaning}
REPLY | r_skipped | OK, I will not ask about that now.
REPLY | r_taught | You taught me about "{word}": {meaning}
REPLY | r_said | {say}
